  "summary_zh": "MPH 是东莞博可威电子科技有限公司（BKW）的小型化金属化聚丙烯膜电容器(浸渍型)（行业型号 C37），额定电压 400VDC/450VDC、500VDC/550VDC、630VDC，电容量范围 0.01μF~2.2μF，工作温度范围 -40℃~+105℃；用于开关电源、电子镇流器和变频器等中间电路直流滤波（DC-link、PFC 等），只适用于直流电路。",
  "summary_en": "BKW MPH: Mini-sized Metallized Polypropylene Film Capacitor (Dipped) (industry code C37). Rated voltage 400/450VDC, 500/550VDC and 630VDC, capacitance 0.01μF–2.2μF, operating temperature -40℃ to +105℃; for DC filtering in SMPS, electronic ballasts and inverters (DC-link, PFC). DC circuits only.",
